  "notes": [
    "qty_str/px_str are the JSON number text as received ('0.01', '60000.1', '59990.0'); the importer must keep the token text (parse_float=Decimal) and never round-trip through binary floats.",
    "pending_new has no canonical event (dropped); 'new' -> ack. Messages after pending_new carry only the changed fields, so order attributes come from the pending_new / snapshot record.",
    "exec_type 'filled' after the last 'trade' is status-only (no exec_id/last_qty) -> no event. The doc's own trade example shows order_status partially_filled for a full fill, so do not infer terminal state from a trade row's order_status.",
    "amended: qty down -> amend_keeps_priority true; price change -> false (Kraken amends guide table). restated (engine-initiated) -> restate.",
    "UNVERIFIED reason strings: Kraken does not document executions 'reason' values. 'Post only order' and 'Self trade prevention' are synthetic placeholders; the importer should map post-only rejection by post_only=true + canceled before any 'new', and STP only by an explicit reason match.",
    "Snapshot order S (open before capture) -> restate, not ack (importer convention, SPEC silent).",
    "GTD has no canonical tif value -> 'other'.",
    "fees[] is a list; one entry here. Multiple entries in different assets cannot fit one fee/fee_ccy pair (SPEC gap)."
  ],
